# Phil Royale — target lock-on (all cards)

Clash Royale–style lock applies to **every** attacking card (troops, buildings, towers):

1. On acquire, lock the nearest valid opponent in range.
2. Keep that lock until the target **dies** or **leaves range**.
3. Do **not** retarget mid-fight just because a closer/higher-priority foe appears.
4. After unlock, acquire the nearest valid opponent in range again.

When adding or changing attacks in `philroyale/`, use the existing `lockKey` / `lockUnitId` paths in `useBattle.ts` — never add free-retarget or “always nearest each tick” behavior unless the user explicitly asks for an exception.
